  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$2 y \\frac{d y}{d x}=6 x^{2} \\Rightarrow \\frac{d y}{d x}=\\frac{3 x^{2}}{y}=-\\frac{3}{4} \\Rightarrow y=-4 x^{2}$ and $y^{2}=2 x^{3}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow 16 x^{4}=2 x^{3} \\Rightarrow x=\\frac{1}{8} \\quad(x \\neq 0)$\r\n$y=\\frac{-1}{16} \\quad(y \\neq 0)$",
